# What the recipes create when they are built inside a corpus clone: the projects' checkouts, build products and
# Node modules. The SatDump stand-ins you write are ignored too, so that they are never committed here (D-152).
libsgp4/repo/
libsgp4/build*/
gpredict/repo/
gpredict/gpredict-harness
satdump/master/
satdump/rel/
satdump/build*/
satdump/stand-ins*.cpp
astroz/repo/
astroz/harness
astroz/vectors
astroz/.zig-cache/
astroz/zig-cache/
gods-eye-view/main/
gods-eye-view/node_modules/
gods-eye-view/package.json
gods-eye-view/package-lock.json
